{
  "description": "Placeholder language vectors shared by the backend and the frontend. 'render' cases give the expected output; 'error' is 'syntax' (parsing fails) or 'render' (a value cannot be rendered). 'tokens' lists the distinct tokens in order of first appearance. Month names are English.",
